  title "Two Halves of the Vastness"
  summary "When a thermal vent fractures beneath the Corpse Current, the hermit magister ☽'Naevaeum~ struggles alone for three days to seal the fissures using ancient techniques, until Zhachelang zhihi'Opalum, a merchant from the Aurora Stack, arrives with emergency supplies and discovers they both bear matching cold-burn marks and share a corrupting connection to something vast beneath the ice. Over months of secret meetings coordinated through a neutral courier, their relationship deepens as they exchange fire-cores and aurora-crystals, each interaction costing ☽'Naevaeum~ their prophetic visions but gaining them genuine human connection. When ☽'Naevaeum~ finally chooses to speak a full sentence to Zhachelang rather than maintain the doctrine's enforced silence, they surrender their sight entirely, and the two sit together in darkness at the ledge, their bond sealed by the cost they have chosen to bear together."
